OL,3,GNEWSAResidents living in 'limbo' after
OL,4,AFairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living close to RAF Fairford
OL,7,Fhave said that they are "living in
OL,8,Flimbo" following the recent arrests
OL,9,Fnear the base.
OL,11,FMore than 80 households in the village
OL,12,Fof Whelford were evacuated from their
OL,13,Fhomes on 27 September 2026 after a
OL,14,Fmajor incident was declared near the
OL,15,Fairbase. Seven people have been
OL,16,Farrested in connection to the incident
OL,17,Fbut no one has been charged.
OL,19,FGlenda Daniels, who has lived in the
OL,20,Fvillage for 23 years, said that the
OL,21,Fincident has left the village with an
OL,22,F"overwhelming feeling of sadness".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
