OL,3,GNEWSAResidents living in 'limbo' after
OL,4,AFairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment representatives have
OL,7,Fdeclined to comment but another
OL,8,Fresident said communication with
OL,9,Fresidents should have been better
OL,10,Fduring the incident.
